OL,3,GNEWSARAF Scampton will return to 'glory
OL,4,Adays', says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former RAF base in Lincolnshire will
OL,7,Freturn to its "glory days" under new
OL,8,Fregeneration plans, says the local MP.
OL,10,FOn Tuesday, it was announced a local
OL,11,Fbid to buy RAF Scampton near Lincoln
OL,12,Fhad been unsuccessful, sparking fresh
OL,13,Ffears over its future.
OL,15,FHowever, Conservative MP for
OL,16,FGainsborough Sir Edward Leigh said the
OL,17,Fbase would be taken over by "a
OL,18,Fworld-class defence company" which
OL,19,Fwould revive its role in defending the
OL,20,Fcountry.
